      "label": "Karta: doma/ilustrace/plamenak.jpg Yt audio: https://youtube.com/shorts/Ub9jlugrUvk?is=e2RbyHyhcfOgdt3n",
      "text": "Karta: doma/ilustrace/plamenak.jpg\n\nYt audio: \nhttps://youtube.com/shorts/Ub9jlugrUvk?is=e2RbyHyhcfOgdt3n",
      "characters": 105,
